From d9d30a4030803c9d617c5f750ce65bc170399f24 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:24:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] DUB BASE v1.2: dub-techno chord sequencer firmware for
 Plaits

TRIG-clocked C minor DUB chord sequencer, envelope on FREQUENCY,
density/length/speed on the attenuverters, 8 chord models (6 poly
models + Plaits CHORDS / STRING MACHINE), always-on random LFO.
v1.2: CHORDS filter follows the inversion; LFO starts at power-on.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0136WGYBVJqXHJBPS2niCsJ8
